## 12. Important Architecture Rules

- Reuse existing current-state data.
- Do not duplicate Kubernetes collection logic.
- Do not run Insight Engine on manual refresh.
- Do not create historical snapshots from manual refresh.
- Do not generate duplicate insights for the same continuing condition.
- Do not hardcode a 1-hour assumption into analytical calculations.
